     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The first upgrade of &#39;secr&#39; for a while is now on CRAN (the Mac binaries will arrive later). 2.10.0 implements a suite of new mark-resight models as documented here: <a href=\"http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-markresight.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-markresight.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488156558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UPhYsxNDWMaFJqK7cI7O_\">secr-markresight.pdf</a> . These are provisional and subject to peer review; please send comments and suggestions for improvement. Other changes are listed <a href=\"http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/secr%202.10.0%20NEWS.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/secr%25202.10.0%2520NEWS.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488156558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BXLUq5ebqBfDWoHsOhLBy\">here</a>. The provisional version 2.10.1 on the <a href=\"http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/SECRinR.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/SECRinR.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488156558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1kA661nM-axIyepfnqbruF\">Density website</a> has bug fixes and other changes, as usual.<br>Murray<br></div>"
